// 15 carried, each transcribed from its own `[floor-cgroup] when=beat-N stat_level=` line and the
// `N minutes in` heartbeat printed beside it). The run REFUSED in strict-preparation on an
// unrelated latent resolve defect fifteen minutes in, so the maximum is over a partial run and is
// a lower bound for that reason as well as for the cadence.
//
// What it shows is the opposite of the hypothesis that motivated it. At beat 14 the held set is
// 26725773568 bytes -- 26664632320 of it anonymous -- against a charge of 26841255936, with
// 13160448 bytes of file left: the cache had already been reclaimed to nothing and what was being
